.task-board/.resources/TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_accepted-contract.md-2-
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_accepted-contract.md-3-**Task:** `TASK-260720-poa3ze`  
